<title>BELGIUM: SOCCER-ANDERLECHT 1 INTERNAZIONALE 1 RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ANDERLECHT 1 INTERNAZIONALE 1 RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anderlecht of Belgium and</p>
<p>Internazionale of Italy drew 1-1 (halftime 1-0) in their UEFA</p>
<p>cup quarter-final first leg match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Anderlecht - Bruno Versavel 27</p>
<p>Internazionale - Maurizio Ganz 75</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,379</p>
<p>Teams:</p>
<p>Anderlecht - 1-Geert De Vlieger; 2-Tibor Selymes, 18-Suad</p>
<p>Katana, 12-Olivier Doll, 14-Samuel Johnson, 4-Celestine</p>
<p>Babayaro, 11-Danny Boffin, 5-Johan Walem, 10-Par Zetterberg,</p>
<p>13-Bruno Versavel, 8-Yaw Preko</p>
<p>Internazionale - 1-Gianluca Pagliuca; 2-Giuseppe Bergomi,</p>
<p>20-Jocelyn Angloma, 7-Salvatore Fresi, 18-Nicola Berti</p>
<p>(23-Maurizio Ganz 65), 4-Javier Zanetti, 19-Massimo Paganin,</p>
<p>8-Paul Ince, 21-Ciriaco Sforza, 9-Ivan Zamorano (27-Marco Branca</p>
<p>66), 6-Youri Djorkaeff (14-Aron Winter 85)</p>
</text>
